  "finalText": "Per the workspace rules, I'll reproduce this with Lightpath first.The summary is served from a cache that markPaid never invalidates. Let me look at the ledger.I fixed it in `server/services/ledger.ts`. I haven't confirmed the fix in the running app.\n\nThe server caches the totals in `summaryCache` and returns that cache from `getSummary()`. `markPaid` changed the invoice but never cleared the cache, so the response to \"Mark as paid\" carried the old Outstanding figure. I added `summaryCache = null;` to `markPaid`, so the next summary is recalculated.\n\nMy repro click already marked the Kestrel Labs invoice (INV-2041) as paid in the running app. I didn't click another invoice to test, so your data stays as it was. To check it, reload the page and mark another open invoice as paid. Outstanding should drop by that invoice's amount.\n\nIf the dev server restarts and reloads the sample data, INV-2041 may be open again.",
